constructed; no future labels.","protected":"No market source/outcome from2026-08-01 onward. Existing sources/environments reused with no downloads or installations; frozen experiments, credentials and user files unchanged.","purpose":"Test whether fixed shrinkage of flat/moving probabilities repairs the remaining combined-score failure without changing up/down forecasts or fitting additional coefficients.","secondary":"frequency_flat=past_frequency_flat, replacing the complex flat model entirely. Report all comparisons and original gates, never promote secondary after seeing results. Old frozen flat is control. Recombine P(down)=(1-flat)*(1-up), P(up)=(1-flat)*up.","status":"Retrospective sequential study on already explored Jan-Jul2024/2025/2026 BTC/ETH/SOL. Uniform-center arm chosen after previous study found it better than volume weighting; it remains a research candidate, not newly independent confirmation."}}
